25,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It takes over an hour for a full pass, and we clearly have different standards of what ""done"" actually means.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The usage is very uneven; a few of us do almost all the cooking, and people are often away for weeks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The bathroom gets dirty again so fast! And @Minako is right, some people just wipe the basin and call it a day.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"We are spending quite a bit on supplies, often buying duplicates, and the management office has a set hourly rate for cleaners.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our past arguments are all about reminders, and the previous tenants warned that permanent assignments ruined their friendship.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if usage is uneven, a simple rotation might feel unfair to those who don't use the kitchen.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. A fixed rota ignores the fact that some of us aren't even here half the time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we don't have a rule, it just stays messy. I hate the guessing game.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps a professional service would remove the stress and the confusion over who paid for the bleach?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,"I agree with Shizue. Avoiding those ""reminders"" that lead to rows is the best way to keep our peace.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A service sounds efficient, but we should consider the time saved versus the cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we pay, the ""usage"" argument disappears because the work is outsourced.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Would a cleaner make the bathroom stay clean longer? I just want it to be consistent.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shizue,,It would certainly make the billing more transparent if we just split one professional invoice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It removes the burden of policing one another, which is where the friction lies.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Minako,,I'm leaning toward a professional service to ensure a standard level of cleanliness.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It's the most logical way to handle uneven usage and absences.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"As long as it's actually clean, I'm happy!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I think it's a lovely way to ensure no one feels burdened or out of pocket.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Servas,,It is the most philosophical choice; investing in our relationship by spending a little money.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
