50,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The options are a Fixed Weekly Rota, a Paid Cleaning Service, or Standing Assignments. I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the data on absences and usage, the Paid Cleaning Service is the only fair option. I vote B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I don't want to fight about the grout anymore. I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service too!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"To keep things simple and fair for everyone's wallet, I vote for Option B.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Servas,,"To preserve our friendship and avoid the pitfalls of the previous tenants, I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
